\begin{document}

\begin{fdu:abstract-en}

This document serves as a user guide for the Fudan University thesis typesetting template based on SILE. SILE (Simon's Improved Layout Engine) is a modern typesetting system that inherits the excellent typesetting philosophy of TeX while using Lua as its extension language, offering high flexibility and customizability.

This template is developed based on SILE 0.15.x and strictly follows the "Fudan University Doctoral and Master's Thesis Regulations (Revised October 2024)". It supports the typesetting of both doctoral and master's degree theses, providing complete thesis structure components including cover page, declaration page, table of contents, abstract, main text, bibliography, appendix, and acknowledgements.

This guide provides detailed instructions on template installation and configuration, basic typesetting features, figure and table examples, reference management, and advanced customization options, aiming to help users quickly get started with the template for thesis typesetting.

\end{fdu:abstract-en}

\end{document}
